  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Heat of reaction at constant pressure is represented by&nbsp;&Delta;H</p><p>Heat of reaction at constant volume is represented by&nbsp;&Delta;U</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#10230;</mo><mn>10</mn><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>We known that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;E</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#916;n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub><mi>RT</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;n</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1228</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>298</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1229393</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Cal</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1229</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>39</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kcal</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
